		"Your computed entitlement was outside the allowed 0–366 day range and has been adjusted. Please contact HR if you expected a different value." : "Su derecho calculado estaba fuera del rango permitido de 0 a 366 días y se ha ajustado. Contacte con RR. HH. si esperaba otro valor.",
		"Your computed entitlement was outside the allowed 0–4000 hour range and has been adjusted. Please contact HR if you expected a different value." : "Su derecho calculado estaba fuera del rango permitido de 0–4000 horas y se ha ajustado. Contacte con RR. HH. si esperaba otro valor.",
